# Everything here is text, and all of it is read by tools that split on lines.
# Normalising to LF in the repository keeps a checkout on one platform from
# producing different results than a checkout on another — which for a
# repository whose entire content is line-oriented checks is not cosmetic.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.md   text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.yml  text eol=lf
